<!-- honesty-ledger
Source: plan.md, shared.md, backend.md, frontend.md, flows.md, schema.mmd, WORKGRAPH.md if present
Unit and denominator: decision-grade plan details; all canonical plan files included
Transform: plan details mirrored into linked Mermaid charts for review
Filter or category selection: only implementation code and file-tree details omitted by spec boundary
Axis/domain: risk charts use confidence x blocking effect; execution charts use dependency order
Caveat: review.mmdx is a checkpoint mirror, not the source of truth
-->

## chart main Slice Plan Review Decision Surface
```mermaid
flowchart LR
  source["Source: 6 plan files + WORKGRAPH if present"]
  verdict["UNKNOWN: replace with READY, REVISE, or BLOCKED"]
  core["Core win and scope"]
  contract["Contract and data"]
  runtime["Runtime behavior"]
  risk["Decision and risk"]
  exec["Execution handoff"]
  action["Human action: approve / revise / block"]

  source --> verdict
  verdict --> core
  verdict --> contract
  verdict --> runtime
  verdict --> risk
  verdict --> exec
  core --> action
  contract --> action
  runtime --> action
  risk --> action
  exec --> action

  classDef high fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef med fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f,stroke-width:2px
  classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef unknown fill:#f3f4f6,stroke:#6b7280,color:#111827,stroke-dasharray: 4 3
  classDef neutral fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#64748b,color:#0f172a
  classDef decision fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#3b0764,stroke-width:2px
  classDef recommended fill:#d1fae5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b,stroke-width:3px
  class source,core,contract,runtime,risk,exec neutral
  class verdict unknown
  class action decision
```

## chart core-scope Core Win And Scope
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  actor["UNKNOWN: primary actor"]
  outcome["UNKNOWN: single user-visible outcome"]
  minimum["UNKNOWN: minimum winning slice"]
  stories["UNKNOWN: all user stories + acceptance coverage"]
  nongoals["UNKNOWN: explicit non-goals"]
  debt["UNKNOWN: debt avoided by deferring scope"]

  actor --> outcome --> minimum --> stories
  minimum --> nongoals --> debt
```

## chart contract-data Contract And Data
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  endpoints["UNKNOWN: every endpoint and auth requirement"]
  shapes["UNKNOWN: request and response shape families"]
  errors["UNKNOWN: every error code"]
  runtime["UNKNOWN: runtime and backpressure contract"]
  schema["UNKNOWN: every entity and relationship from schema.mmd"]
  siblings["UNKNOWN: sibling FKs or owned entities"]

  endpoints --> shapes --> errors
  endpoints --> runtime
  shapes --> schema --> siblings
```

## chart runtime-behavior Runtime Behavior
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  flows["UNKNOWN: every user journey and failure path"]
  backend["UNKNOWN: backend rules, permissions, jobs, edge cases"]
  frontend["UNKNOWN: screens, roles, states, interactions"]
  perf["UNKNOWN: SLOs, load assumptions, verification"]
  db["UNKNOWN: DB transition plan if production data is affected"]

  flows --> backend
  flows --> frontend
  backend --> perf
  frontend --> perf
  perf --> db
```

## chart decision-risk Decision And Risk
```mermaid
quadrantChart
  title Decision And Risk Review
  x-axis High confidence --> Low confidence
  y-axis Low blocking effect --> High blocking effect
  "UNKNOWN: replace with top blocker": [0.80, 0.85]
  "OK: replace with accepted decision": [0.20, 0.20]
```

## chart execution-handoff Execution Handoff
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  wg["UNKNOWN: WORKGRAPH nodes if present"]
  deps["UNKNOWN: dependency edges"]
  writes["UNKNOWN: writes ownership"]
  checks["UNKNOWN: validation commands"]
  gates["UNKNOWN: risk gates and human-only steps"]

  wg --> deps --> writes --> checks --> gates
```
